      47.85,
      356.17,
      539.92,
      415.24
    ],
    "text": "I, Chamara Sampath Dassanayaka, Chief Minister of Provincial Council of Uva Province, Minister of Finance, PolicyPlanning, Law and Order, Education, Local Government, Land, Power and Energy, Construction and Rural InfrastructureFacilities, according to the powers assigned to me under the Article 5 of Financial Statute No. 08 of 1990, notify that theturnover tax will be implemented from 01.07.2017 for the wholesale and retail businesses making a turnover more thanRupees Five Hundred Thousand (Rs. 500,000) and less than Rupees Three Million (Rs. 3,000,000) per quarter.",
